    "authored-1": {
      "id": "authored-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The MCP package turns the authoring store into a multi-project external tool connection in "
        },
        {
          "insert": "packages/prompt-kit-mcp/src/service.ts",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true,
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "packages/prompt-kit-mcp/src/service.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ". It does not start a model."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "authored-2": {
      "id": "authored-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Governed by"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "authored-3": {
      "id": "authored-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "MCP Protocol",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "doc",
              "path": "10-system-design/90-external-authoring/10-protocol"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " owns public task behavior. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Prompt Edit Transaction Guide",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "doc",
              "path": "10-system-design/90-external-authoring/20-operations"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " owns edit semantics."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "authored-4": {
      "id": "authored-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Ownership"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "authored-5": {
      "id": "authored-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Transport and client installation stay in the MCP package. The shared filesystem server and pure library do not depend on MCP or Agent Kernel. Runtime state belongs to an authenticated local daemon, and source documents remain on disk. Agents read the guidance through "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_capabilities",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_guidance",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", so the installer writes no skill and removes the skill copies that earlier installs wrote."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "authored-6": {
      "id": "authored-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Clients share one endpoint, while Kernel hosts can save through the filesystem library independently. The same split applies to future client adapters and transports."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "cg-1": {
      "id": "cg-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Capabilities and Guidance"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "cg-2": {
      "id": "cg-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A client calls "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_capabilities",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " once per thread, before the first Prompt Kit tool. It returns the capabilities index in pages of 4,096 bytes or less, with no standards text. The guidance rules come from "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_guidance",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " topics, one topic at a time."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "cg-3": {
      "id": "cg-3",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The index lists each guidance topic with its size, its part count, and the writes it unlocks."
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "cg-4",
        "cg-5",
        "cg-6"
      ]
    },
    "cg-4": {
      "id": "cg-4",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "It also lists the tool order, the project IDs, and the guidance snapshot."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "cg-5": {
      "id": "cg-5",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "It names "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_discover",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " as the discovery tool with the prompt count. Pass "
        },
        {
          "insert": "project",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " to "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_discover",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " for one project's prompts."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "cg-6": {
      "id": "cg-6",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Every call rescans the workspace. A cursor from a changed project list is refused, and an unchanged rescan keeps it valid."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
