    "authored-11": {
      "id": "authored-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Run package tests and typechecks for store or tool changes. The installed-connection exercise in "
        },
        {
          "insert": "scripts/verify-installed-mcp.ts",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true,
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "scripts/verify-installed-mcp.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " uses real client configuration, reads the catalog, and edits a disposable standalone fixture through two MCP clients. It verifies derived rendering, stale-save rejection, completion, and undo without modifying catalog prompts."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "authored-12": {
      "id": "authored-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Installer tests cover preservation of unrelated settings, unmanaged-name collisions, removal of installer-owned legacy entries, the removal of old skill copies, and rollback after a later file fails to commit. Protocol success does not establish that an already-open client UI has reloaded its tools."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
